SDL Tunneler: the keys
======================

Two players, one keyboard, a split screen. Each drives a tank through
the earth: find the other tank and destroy it. Driving through earth is
slow, through your own tunnels fast; your base (in your colour) fills up
your energy and shields.

                 Player 1          Player 2
  Up             Cursor Up         W
  Down           Cursor Down       S
  Left           Cursor Left       A
  Right          Cursor Right      D
  Fire           Right Shift       Ctrl

  Esc            end the game, and back to the menu

The keys, the window size and full screen are set in Settings on the
menu; they are kept in the drawer's Tunneler.prefs.

Against the computer, from a Shell (0 is player 1, 1 player 2):
  Tunneler -ai 1
Other options: -w <width> -h <height> --fullscreen

The keys every AmiCradle game has on Right Amiga (GFOpenUp's SDL2.module):
Right Amiga + F window or full screen, + P pause, + Q quit, + M free the
mouse pointer, + S a screenshot in the drawer's Screenshots, and Help
shows this file.
